                <note rend="inline" type="source">467.11/971: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in Turkey</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Skinner</hi>) <hi
                        rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of
                    State</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Istanbul</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1934-12-24T13:00:00+02:00">December 24, 1934—1
                        p.m.</date><lb/>[Received December 24—11:30 a.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>82. Claims agreement ratified yesterday by Grand National Assembly.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Skinner</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
